# The front door of Oddboro, seen from the street. Double glass doors
# in a walnut frame under a transom, teal kick panels, brass pulls. A teal and
# cream awning spans three tiles over it with ODDBORO on the valance in
# backlit letters. The sprite is 48 wide so the awning overhangs a cell either
# side; those cells stay transparent below the awning so the brick shows and
# the wall lanterns can hang there. The glass is the warm window key, so the
# lobby reads as lit after dark. Covers two D cells on the street face.
# Frame "closed" first, so it is the default; "open" shows the leaves swung in.
sprite street-front-door
size 48 32
layer wall
footprint 2 1
origin 8 16
tag wall door entrance

frame closed
